  dialogueLines:
  - Shh. Not for the fish. For the herons. They judge.
  - Net's fouled on a snag off the bank. Third time this season. Creek keeps what
    it likes.
  - Free it if you're wading anyway. I'll owe you a fish I haven't caught.
